# sample-notes

Counts words and lists the headings of one markdown file.

## Procedure
1. Read the file the user names.
2. Run `python3 scripts/count_words.py FILE` and report the numbers it prints.
3. List the headings in order.

## Evidence rules
Report the script output as given; do not estimate.
